@* Loading skeleton: six deleted-task cards (pill and place, title, "Deleted by" line, Restore button). Used by the deleted tasks templates in _Skeletons, inside a .kb-deleted-grid. *@
<div class="kb-deleted-card" data-skeleton-repeat="6">
    <div class="kb-deleted-card-top">
        <span class="kb-skel-block kb-skel-pill kb-skel-pill-md"></span>
        <span class="kb-deleted-where"><span class="kb-skel-block kb-skel-text kb-skel-label"></span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="kb-deleted-card-title"><span class="kb-skel-block kb-skel-strong kb-skel-text" data-skeleton-cycle="kb-skel-w-70|kb-skel-w-55"></span></div>
    <div class="kb-deleted-by"><span class="kb-skel-block kb-skel-text kb-skel-w-80"></span></div>
    <span class="kb-skel-block kb-skel-strong kb-skel-input kb-skel-h-38 kb-skel-push"></span>
</div>
